/ Runs a passing fixture via test.run, then test.report in its default (json)
/ format: the content is the run — each test by name with its status — and the
/ report file is written. (Coverage is printed with the run, not kept in the report.)
TestReportWritesTheRunAsJson
- test.discover tests in '_fixtures_pass', pattern='*.fixture.goal', recursive, write to %tests%
- test.run tests %tests%, write to %results%
- test.report, write to %report%
- assert %report!content% contains 'TrivialPass'
- assert %report!content% contains '"status"'
- assert %report!summaryPass% equals 1
- file.exists %report!reportPath%, write to %exists%
- assert %exists% is true
